    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"Approximately 800 USGS publications between 1965 and 1993 contain computer programs either in hard copy form (source code), or more recently, on microcomputer diskettes.  These computer programs have been released as formal and informal USGS publications including Professional Papers, Bulletins, Water-Supply Papers, Circulars, Techniques of Water-Resources Investigations, Water-Resources Investigations, and Open-File Reports.  This diskette contains a searchable data base of bibliographic citations of USGS publications through June 1993 containing computer programs and supersedes Open-File Report 89-681 (Orndorff and others, 1989).\"",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
